  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><sup><strong>Source:</strong> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/574642/diamond-spheres-erudition-esoterica\">Diamond Spheres: Erudition &amp; Esoterica</a></sup></p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisites</strong>: Perception 15 ranks, associated skill 15 ranks, Investigation sphere.</p>\n<p>As a free action, you can spend 2 uses of skill leverage to enter a brief state of hyper-awareness of your current surroundings. You immediately gain 1d3 rounds worth of actions, although the actions themselves can only be mental-based actions (excluding spells cast only using your mind). You can move in the form of an astral projection, but you cannot move beyond your analyze range while doing so, nor can you physically interact with objects or creatures.</p>\n<p>At 20 ranks in this sphere's associated skill, you gain 1 additional round worth of actions when using this ability.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/investigation#toc52\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
